# en: "It's straw, and it won't do a thing this time. Hit it. Get its Health to nothing and you've won."
fight.coach.idle = “它是草扎的，这回什么都不会做。打它。把它的生命打到零，你就赢了。”
# en: "See what it's committed to? You often will. It means to swing at you. Guard."
fight.coach.strike = “看见它出的什么招了？你常常能看见。它要朝你挥过来。格挡。”
# en: "Fire, this time. A Guard takes only half a spell; a Ward stops all of it, but only half a blow. Pick your shield for the hit that's coming."
fight.coach.spell = “这回是火。格挡只能挡下一半咒语；护界能挡下整道咒语，可打击只能挡一半。看清要来的是什么，再选你的盾。”
# en: "It's hiding behind its guard. The Mana you spend turns to flux; Reclaim turns it back. Do it when nothing can hurt you. Like now."
fight.coach.guard = “它躲在格挡后面。你花掉的法力会变成游离法力；回收能把它变回来。挑没东西能伤到你的时候做。比如现在。”
# en: "Now it's reclaiming, and while it does, it's open. Make it pay."
fight.coach.reclaim = “现在它在回收，回收的时候它是敞开的。让它付出代价。”
# en: "From here you take turns. This time you commit first and it sees your move; next time you'll see its. Think what it will do with what it sees."
fight.coach.commit = “从这里起轮流先出招。这回你先出，它能看见你的招；下回你能看见它的。想想它看见之后会怎么做。”
# en: "That's a duel. Finish it."
fight.coach.finish = “这就是决斗。收尾吧。”
# en: The mannequin moves first and shows you its move: read it before you pick yours.
fight.coach.lead = 木人先出招，并亮出它的招式：看清了再选你的。
# en: Each button shows what it does and what it costs. Strike is free; spells cost Mana.
fight.coach.read = 每个按钮都写着效果和消耗。打击不花钱；咒语要耗法力。
# en: A ward stops a spell and halves a blow. Raise it when something is coming.
fight.coach.ward = 护界能挡下一道咒语、减半一次打击。有东西要来时就举起它。
# en: Spent Mana becomes loose magic (the ↻ on your bar): Reclaim gathers it back.
fight.coach.mana = 花掉的法力会化作游离魔力（法力条上的 ↻）：回收能把它收回来。
